                                        <span id="srvFormTotalTimeBadge" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold bg-[#FFDD2D]/40 border border-[#FFDD2D] text-slate-900 shadow-2xs">Cəmi: 45 dəq</span>
